  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mauritania Fiscal Management and Resilience Development Policy Financing with a Catastrophe Deferred Drawdown Option</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Program Development Objective (PDO) is  to strengthen the foundations for: (i) sound fiscal and debt management; and (ii) a competitive and climate-resilient economy.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The development objective of the Fiscal Management and Resilience Development Policy Financing with a Catastrophe Deferred Drawdown Option for Mauritania is to strengthen the foundations for: (i) sound fiscal and debt management; and (ii) a competitive and climate-resilient economy. The operation is designed to support reforms in the areas of fiscal and debt management and strengthen economic competitiveness and resilience to climate change and disaster risks.</narrative>
  </description>
